+# FRACTAL-FLOW — Stage H.1.1 Corrective Design Specification
+**Document:** `artifacts/stage_h1_1/01_CORRECTIVE_DESIGN.md`  
+**Governing Standard:** Universal Forensic Engineering Protocol  
